Resource Mounts to Contents ConfigMap <code>ppxai-server-config</code> ppxai-server pods <code>ppxai-config.json</code> ConfigMap <code>ppxai-session-manager-config</code> session-manager max_sessions, registry_path, workspace_size, temp_size, ttl_minutes ConfigMap <code>ppxai-webapp-nginx</code> ppxai-webapp pods <code>nginx.conf.tmpl</code> (envsubst on <code>$PPXAI_SERVER_URL</code>) ConfigMap <code>ppxai-login-config</code> login-service session_manager_url, app_title, max_sessions Secret <code>ppxai-api-keys</code> ppxai-server pods <code>.env</code> (provider API keys) <p>Pod-level env vars injected by session manager at creation time:</p> <pre><code>ppxai-server-&lt;user&gt;:  PPXAI_WORKING_DIR=/workspace  PPXAI_DATA_DIR=/tmp/session  PPXAI_USERNAME=&lt;user&gt;
ppxai-webapp-&lt;user&gt;:  PPXAI_SERVER_URL=http://ppxai-server-&lt;user&gt;.ppxai-system.svc:54320
</code></pre>
